  "item_short_desc": "<p>Make the most of your travel, work, and play with our Canvas Parachute Cargo Bag! The extra-large canvas bag has a 75L storage capacity and measures 24 inch x 15 inch x 13 inch, offering unlimited storage potential. The bag can be folded flat for easy storage, and is great for weekend getaways, outdoor adventures, and business trips! Get your cargo bag today and experience the ultimate rugged carry-all bag like never before!</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "7568",
  "description": "<p>Make the most of your travel, work, and play with our Canvas Parachute Cargo Bag! The extra-large canvas bag has a 75L storage capacity and measures 24 inch x 15 inch x 13 inch, offering unlimited storage potential. The bag can be folded flat for easy storage, and is great for weekend getaways, outdoor adventures, and business trips! Get your cargo bag today and experience the ultimate rugged carry-all bag like never before! Rothco&rsquo;s canvas collection features top-of-the-line hardware and trims. Every detail that goes into our canvas products is intended to serve you when you need it most and look good while doing so. Top Grade Canvas: Made from Rothco&rsquo;s durable heavyweight canvas fabric, this superior material is naturally water-resistant, rugged, and is built for the long haul. No one comes close to Rothco&rsquo;s collection of premium canvas bags and packs. All-Purpose Bag: The large-capacity duffle bag will hold all your gear! It is perfect for storing clothes, uniforms, outdoor sports gear, tactical supplies, laundry, general storage, and more. Fast &amp; Easy Access: A heavy-duty full-length zipper closure provides quick and easy access to your possessions inside the travel bag. In addition, the quick-access snap-flap covers the length of the zipper for a clean look. Long-Lasting Durability: This travel bag is built tough with reinforced cross-stitching web handles that offer additional support for heavy cargo loads. The durable web handles are designed to make lifting and carrying gear easy. Alternative Carry: The two d-rings located on each side of the canvas bag can be used to attach a shoulder strap for either an over-the-shoulder or crossbody carry.</p>",
